WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.308
The pronunciation of letters can depend on neighbouring letters. In words like car

00:00:05.308 --> 00:00:09.629
and bird, r changes the vowel sound; suffixes alter syllable patterns.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.122
Which word contains the sound /th/ as in thin? Answer: thumb

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:21.830
Sort words by hard/soft c and g sounds, then read r-controlled words and words with

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:22.222
suffixes.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.423
Why it works: Thumb begins with th.
